WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Build the system before the identity.

00:03.000 --> 00:07.000
Proportions, silhouette, and movement stay consistent.

00:07.000 --> 00:10.500
Face, hair, palette, and wardrobe create identity.

00:10.500 --> 00:13.500
Test the design through camera, scene, and motion.

00:13.500 --> 00:16.000
One approved base can carry many identities.
